{"candidateAnswer":"July 2022, after returning from her research trip to Woodhaven.","evidence":"[D12:13 | 7:49 pm on 20 May, 2022] Nate: Wow, that looks great Joanna! Is that your third one?\n[D12:14 | 7:49 pm on 20 May, 2022] Joanna: Yep! I chose to write about this because it's really personal. It's about loss, identity, and connection. It's a story I've had for ages but just got the guts to write it. It was hard, but I'm so proud of it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:877d8857-6f88-57bb-b1ef-558463807835","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2cc53d7379379f2fe0c2d50ce2ddd9d73359eaeb32e8dddf34e9433aeb493bc3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Joanna start writing her third screenplay?","referenceAnswer":"May 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2cc53d7379379f2fe0c2d50ce2ddd9d73359eaeb32e8dddf34e9433aeb493bc3"}}]}